WEBVTT

00:10.510 --> 00:12.590
<i>Thank you for choosing our company.</i>

00:13.090 --> 00:14.970
<i>To use the lines</i>

00:15.140 --> 00:18.890
<i>Chuo, Yamanote, Keihin-Tohoku, Tokaido, Joban,</i>

00:19.060 --> 00:20.980
<i>Sobu and Keio lines,</i>

00:21.230 --> 00:23.980
<i>or the Tohoku, Hokuriku, and Joetsu high-speed lines,</i>

00:24.150 --> 00:26.020
<i>please get off at this station.</i>

00:26.440 --> 00:30.860
<i>Our Hikari 519 train is scheduled to depart</i>

00:31.690 --> 00:33.360
<i>at 5:54 p.m.</i>

00:43.040 --> 00:43.910
Excuse me, miss.

00:44.460 --> 00:46.710
Miss?

00:50.630 --> 00:52.510
You've reached your destination.

00:53.670 --> 00:55.010
Thank you.

00:59.220 --> 01:02.770
I was supposed to stop at Shinagawa and change lines,

01:03.890 --> 01:05.520
and boom, I'm in Tokyo.

01:05.770 --> 01:09.610
The blue line, eh...

01:10.980 --> 01:13.360
Fantastic, it's all sky blue and indigo.

01:15.200 --> 01:20.200
Kamata and Kannai, Kamata and Kannai...

01:20.410 --> 01:24.910
Kamata and Kannai, Kamata and Kannai...

01:25.290 --> 01:28.670
Grilled eel, breaded pork and curry for you!

01:29.710 --> 01:34.220
Grilled eel, breaded pork...
Grilled eel, breaded pork and curry...

01:34.380 --> 01:39.050
Grilled eel, breaded pork...
Grilled eel, breaded pork and curry...

01:40.100 --> 01:41.760
Wow, this is incredible.

01:45.640 --> 01:47.140
So...

01:48.480 --> 01:50.940
Yokohama, Yokohama, Yokohama.

01:55.820 --> 02:00.450
<i>In March, at the age of 17,
I left everything behind to go to Tokyo.</i>

02:01.370 --> 02:04.200
<i>Because I refuse to give up and admit defeat.</i>

02:10.420 --> 02:11.500
It's snowing!

03:50.600 --> 03:53.900
LONG LIVE TOKYO

03:54.440 --> 03:55.690
Good evening...

03:56.150 --> 03:57.900
Anybody home?

03:58.360 --> 04:01.700
CLOSED REAL ESTATE AGENCY MAE

03:58.530 --> 04:01.070
I've come to collect some keys, on behalf of Iseri.

04:01.860 --> 04:05.070
AGENCY STATION KAWASAKI

04:02.410 --> 04:05.070
Mouais, not surprising. I'm super late.

04:06.330 --> 04:07.080
Nothing to do.

04:07.240 --> 04:09.080
AGENCE STATION KAWASAKI

04:11.330 --> 04:12.580
Well, then...

04:15.580 --> 04:16.590
This must be it.

04:21.550 --> 04:23.340
Excuse me, could you tell me...

04:38.690 --> 04:41.030
- Enough of this racket!
- Ah, sorry!

04:46.280 --> 04:46.990
I'm there.

04:50.540 --> 04:52.540
Well, of course.

04:58.130 --> 05:01.590
There's often a spare hidden in places like this.

05:02.470 --> 05:03.300
Or not.

05:03.470 --> 05:04.300
How can I help you?

05:04.590 --> 05:05.300
Ouch!

05:06.800 --> 05:09.390
I live right here. Can I help you with something?

05:11.640 --> 05:14.940
Um... I'm the new neighbor, Iseri.

05:15.100 --> 05:17.520
Oh, right. Welcome, then.

05:17.690 --> 05:18.610
Thank you.

05:19.190 --> 05:21.030
Problem, I don't have my keys.

05:21.400 --> 05:24.280
I was supposed to pick them up at the agency,

05:24.450 --> 05:27.030
- but I was late...
- Did you call them?

05:28.200 --> 05:31.160
- My phone died.
- You can use mine.

05:32.040 --> 05:34.500
That's sweet, but the number's in my phone book.

05:34.830 --> 05:37.750
Ah, damn it. Listen, why don't you recharge it at our place?

05:38.830 --> 05:41.250
Come on in. We don't mind, really.

05:44.130 --> 05:47.300
Oh no, I don't want to bother you. I can manage.

05:47.510 --> 05:48.930
Thanks, anyway.

05:49.550 --> 05:52.640
I'll leave my suitcase with you, if you don't mind!

05:53.060 --> 05:54.640
CAFÉ MARUFUKU

05:56.560 --> 05:57.400
Ah, at last!

05:57.560 --> 05:58.400
8 MISSED CALLS 9 MESSAGES

05:58.690 --> 05:59.650
Inevitably.

05:59.980 --> 06:00.900
SUZUNE

06:03.280 --> 06:03.900
Hi, it's me.

06:04.240 --> 06:05.650
<i>About time.</i>

06:05.820 --> 06:07.860
<i>Mommy! I've got Nina on the phone.</i>

06:08.320 --> 06:10.320
Sorry, my battery ran out.

06:11.030 --> 06:14.750
<i>What the hell are you doing? He called us.</i>

06:14.910 --> 06:16.460
<i>Apparently, you stood him up.</i>

06:17.580 --> 06:18.670
Yes, I know.

06:19.330 --> 06:20.580
I'll go tomorrow without fail.

06:20.880 --> 06:22.380
<i>She's on her own.</i>

06:22.550 --> 06:23.130
See ya.

06:23.500 --> 06:26.470
<i>Tell me, do you really think this is the solution?</i>

06:26.630 --> 06:28.470
I'm sorry, you're breaking up.

06:39.480 --> 06:40.190
TEMPLE VISIT IN KYOTO

06:41.440 --> 06:42.480
THE WHEEL TURNS! (LOL)

06:43.900 --> 06:45.320
TONIGHT, LIVE CONCERT AT THIS PLACE

06:46.530 --> 06:48.820
It's next door. What, at 10 p.m.?

06:48.990 --> 06:49.820
KAWASAKI STATION

06:51.490 --> 06:52.280
You've got to be kidding me!

07:17.020 --> 07:20.440
<i>Everything's so white
Everything's so slow</i>

07:20.730 --> 07:26.030
<i>All answers are empty of substance</i>

07:26.650 --> 07:31.360
<i>My fingers are static
My fingers are trembling</i>

07:31.610 --> 07:35.120
<i>There's no written answer
No stinging failure</i>

07:35.280 --> 07:37.950
<i>I've always been who I am</i>

07:38.120 --> 07:40.960
- It's here...
<i>- I'll stay who I was</i>

07:41.120 --> 07:48.550
<i>No matter how hard I fight
There will be no tomorrow</i>

07:50.260 --> 07:51.010
Say...

07:52.930 --> 07:53.970
Excuse me!

07:55.140 --> 07:58.020
Are you Momoka Kawaragi?

07:58.310 --> 07:58.810
Yes.

07:59.310 --> 08:00.770
I'm a big fan!

08:01.020 --> 08:04.190
Of Diamond Dust, of course, but of you too...

08:05.020 --> 08:05.940
How nice of you.

08:06.690 --> 08:10.150
In fact, I love your songs, you're so talented.

08:10.320 --> 08:12.910
I left my country home today,

08:13.070 --> 08:15.320
and your music helped me take the plunge.

08:15.870 --> 08:16.780
Oh, yeah?

08:16.950 --> 08:19.120
Yeah, you have no idea!

08:19.660 --> 08:22.710
I don't know, I must have listened to your stuff a thousand times.

08:23.500 --> 08:27.340
So when I saw that you were playing tonight, I figured it was

08:27.670 --> 08:28.960
it was fate.

08:29.760 --> 08:31.590
Fate wants you to buy my CD.

08:31.920 --> 08:33.840
Ah yes, of course!

08:35.430 --> 08:36.350
1,000 yen, huh?

08:38.560 --> 08:39.180
Sounds great.

08:40.310 --> 08:41.230
That'll do it.

08:43.310 --> 08:45.230
It's not even close.

08:47.900 --> 08:49.360
Let's relax a bit.

08:50.530 --> 08:53.150
What, did I say something stupid?

08:54.660 --> 08:55.490
Of course not.

08:55.950 --> 08:59.490
On the contrary, it's nice to have fans like you.

09:02.200 --> 09:03.160
Hey, you.

09:06.790 --> 09:11.130
I thought I'd made myself clear. This is our territory.

09:11.590 --> 09:14.180
Is it? I don't see your name anywhere.

09:14.840 --> 09:17.140
Why don't you go play somewhere else?

09:21.310 --> 09:22.020
Get over here.

09:23.140 --> 09:24.100
Ah, uh, yeah.

09:24.390 --> 09:24.890
Hey!

09:30.400 --> 09:31.690
I'll show you!

09:31.860 --> 09:32.570
Hurry up!

09:33.150 --> 09:35.150
- What's up? - You're dead!

09:35.320 --> 09:36.360
NAKAMISE STREET

09:36.990 --> 09:38.570
I've got nothing to do with this!

09:38.910 --> 09:40.370
Yes, you did.

09:40.530 --> 09:43.830
If you tell them nicely that you don't know me,

09:44.000 --> 09:44.870
who knows...

09:45.040 --> 09:46.120
Come back, I'm telling you!

09:46.500 --> 09:47.500
Yeah, no, forget it.

09:48.330 --> 09:49.000
Come this way!

09:50.290 --> 09:51.420
Damn it.

09:59.600 --> 10:00.550
Stupid.

10:01.180 --> 10:03.520
What does that gesture mean exactly?

10:03.680 --> 10:05.270
It's a sign of thanks.

10:05.640 --> 10:08.060
Go figure out why they're so pissed off.

10:10.110 --> 10:10.940
What's your name?

10:12.230 --> 10:13.030
Nina.

10:14.150 --> 10:15.280
Iseri Nina.

10:17.150 --> 10:18.910
Kawasaki and Shin-Kawasaki?

10:19.320 --> 10:23.240
Logically, Kawasaki should be after Shin-Kawasaki, shouldn't it?

10:23.410 --> 10:24.500
But here, not at all.

10:24.660 --> 10:26.290
I had to check, too.

10:26.460 --> 10:28.290
My battery was dead.

10:28.750 --> 10:30.540
And you found yourself outside.

10:30.920 --> 10:35.340
My uncle told me this was the best place to live in Tokyo.

10:35.510 --> 10:36.630
Yeah, right.

10:36.800 --> 10:37.550
Tokyo?

10:37.720 --> 10:38.550
What about it?

10:38.930 --> 10:40.720
Kawasaki isn't in Tokyo at all.

10:40.890 --> 10:43.930
It's in Kanagawa, like the city of Yokohama.

10:44.100 --> 10:46.600
He assured me it was on the outskirts of Tokyo...

10:46.850 --> 10:49.810
Well, you've been had.

10:49.980 --> 10:52.060
We had to give you a shabby studio.

10:52.520 --> 10:54.690
That explains why the rent's so low.

10:54.980 --> 10:57.490
You know, I think it's nice, Kawasaki.

10:57.650 --> 11:00.990
Yeah, you're not wrong. I've met you, after all.

11:01.280 --> 11:04.910
I'm still carrying around the ticket to your concert...

11:05.080 --> 11:06.370
that was cancelled.

11:06.790 --> 11:08.750
Would you autograph it for me?

11:10.710 --> 11:11.960
Here you go.

11:12.460 --> 11:13.920
Rice with beef strips.

11:15.460 --> 11:17.670
Holy cow, it's huge!

11:18.630 --> 11:21.220
What, you've never eaten it?
Where did you just come from?

11:21.390 --> 11:22.350
Kumamoto.

11:22.510 --> 11:24.060
Isn't there a restaurant in your town?

11:24.350 --> 11:25.100
There is.

11:25.390 --> 11:29.560
Except with my family, we never eat out.

11:29.980 --> 11:31.230
<i>Family precepts</i>

11:30.140 --> 11:32.560
Are you serious? What are you, a rich kid?

11:32.940 --> 11:34.860
Well, that's beside the point.

11:37.150 --> 11:40.200
Wow, this is so good! A real marvel!

11:40.360 --> 11:41.530
Is it that good?

11:41.700 --> 11:42.410
Yes!

11:44.530 --> 11:45.870
I really enjoyed it.

11:48.330 --> 11:49.870
The last train is coming soon.

11:50.410 --> 11:51.670
What's the plan?

11:52.000 --> 11:53.040
I'm going to improvise.

11:53.750 --> 11:54.880
Improvise what?

11:58.010 --> 11:58.710
Come on, let's go.

11:59.420 --> 12:02.090
Enjoy your evening. I'll pay for both of us.

12:02.840 --> 12:04.470
Thank you very much. Thank you.

12:05.720 --> 12:08.390
Always take care of your fans.

12:11.230 --> 12:12.520
That was excellent.

12:13.100 --> 12:14.440
Thank you so much!

12:15.230 --> 12:16.690
I'm going to do it.

12:16.900 --> 12:18.480
See you soon!

12:20.280 --> 12:24.370
Why did you lie to me, huh?
That doesn't say thank you at all!

12:24.530 --> 12:25.410
Sorry about that.

12:26.030 --> 12:27.450
Are we there yet?

12:27.620 --> 12:31.620
I'm warning you, it's freezing.
The heating doesn't work.

12:31.790 --> 12:33.170
Is this your parents' place?

12:33.580 --> 12:36.170
Nothing... to... see.

12:37.500 --> 12:40.050
Come in, it takes me a lifetime to get these pumps off.

12:40.210 --> 12:41.170
It's straight ahead.

12:41.630 --> 12:42.930
Allow me, then.

12:50.600 --> 12:52.600
The switch is on the left.

13:00.150 --> 13:01.320
Aren't you afraid of cats?

13:02.990 --> 13:05.740
Sit down, I'll make some coffee.

13:05.910 --> 13:07.320
That's nice of you. Thank you.

13:09.200 --> 13:10.330
It's superb.

13:10.660 --> 13:11.830
Ah, you play?

13:12.000 --> 13:14.830
Absolutely not, but I'd love to.

13:15.460 --> 13:16.420
Would you like to try it?

13:16.830 --> 13:17.840
Are you sure?

13:20.250 --> 13:20.880
Yes, I'm sure.

13:21.960 --> 13:24.340
Wow. I had no idea it was so heavy.

13:24.760 --> 13:26.220
You've got a funny look.

13:27.140 --> 13:28.100
I'm not surprised.

13:28.430 --> 13:29.720
I'm just teasing.

13:29.890 --> 13:32.850
Anybody can look good with a guitar.

13:33.230 --> 13:34.890
What are you, in high school?

13:35.140 --> 13:37.230
Close. I'm 17 years old.

13:37.520 --> 13:40.150
I'd be a senior if I hadn't given up everything.

13:42.610 --> 13:43.650
Would you like some sugar?

13:43.990 --> 13:44.990
I'd love some.

13:45.450 --> 13:48.030
You know, I too,

13:48.240 --> 13:51.370
left everything behind when I was your age to come here.

13:51.740 --> 13:53.370
And it's already been three years.

13:53.660 --> 13:56.000
What, are you only 20?

13:56.420 --> 13:58.630
That wording is almost offensive.

13:59.130 --> 14:01.630
Who knows, maybe it's fate.

14:01.800 --> 14:03.460
Yes, I'm sure it is.

14:04.130 --> 14:06.800
- By the way, um...
- You arrived today, right?

14:07.130 --> 14:09.140
Yes, I did. And, about my autograph...

14:09.470 --> 14:12.560
That's funny, because I'm going back to Asahikawa tomorrow.

14:13.930 --> 14:15.270
<i>Girls Band Cry.</i>

14:17.100 --> 14:17.900
What do you mean, "Girls Band Cry"?

14:18.270 --> 14:20.480
I'm moving. I'm setting sail.

14:20.820 --> 14:23.650
I'm leaving the capital and saying goodbye to music.

14:24.860 --> 14:28.780
But why? You're super talented.
Your compositions are great.

14:29.870 --> 14:30.780
You're cute.

14:30.950 --> 14:31.780
It'll get cold.

14:33.700 --> 14:34.540
Momoka.

14:34.870 --> 14:37.580
Put yourself in my shoes. We don't always make it.

14:37.920 --> 14:41.000
Besides, I'm barely surviving with my music.

14:41.170 --> 14:43.300
I'm doing job after job after job.

14:43.880 --> 14:48.430
Okay, but that song... it was a big hit.

14:51.300 --> 14:52.760
But it doesn't belong to me.

14:53.600 --> 14:56.100
I gave up all my rights to it.

14:59.310 --> 15:00.230
I want to know everything.

15:01.310 --> 15:02.150
I'm listening.

15:02.310 --> 15:03.690
You'd better not.

15:04.110 --> 15:04.780
Come on!

15:04.940 --> 15:07.280
You composed it, after all!

15:07.450 --> 15:09.700
You couldn't give it away like that!

15:10.110 --> 15:10.870
Yes, I could.

15:11.030 --> 15:11.990
No, you couldn't.

15:12.910 --> 15:15.700
- I'm telling you I did.
- You're lying.

15:16.330 --> 15:18.870
You're so stubborn. You're a Southerner.

15:19.040 --> 15:20.120
That's me.

15:22.750 --> 15:23.840
Stop, we're talking.

15:26.960 --> 15:27.720
Hands off.

15:29.050 --> 15:29.840
This is crazy.

15:30.010 --> 15:33.720
You could barely get two words out before. You're weird.

15:34.060 --> 15:35.470
See, this song...

15:37.680 --> 15:39.020
Good evening.

15:39.190 --> 15:40.520
Good evening...

15:40.690 --> 15:43.690
The neighbors will start complaining again if you make any noise.

15:43.940 --> 15:46.110
We're having a party tonight?

15:47.740 --> 15:48.440
Tell me...

15:48.610 --> 15:49.570
This is...

15:49.900 --> 15:53.450
Your boyfriend? Like, you live together? Ouch!

15:53.820 --> 15:56.240
Relax for a second.

15:56.410 --> 15:58.410
He's my roommate, nothing more.

15:58.580 --> 16:01.290
I can't pay the rent on my own.

16:01.460 --> 16:03.080
I mean, he's a guy!

16:03.460 --> 16:05.750
Yeah... but a guy who likes guys.

16:05.920 --> 16:08.590
He's probably off to meet his boyfriend.

16:08.760 --> 16:09.670
Boyfriend?

16:12.430 --> 16:15.720
Wow, Tokyo is like another world!

16:15.890 --> 16:19.390
Kawasaki and I have very different schedules.

16:19.560 --> 16:22.100
- We hardly ever see each other.
- Still...

16:22.440 --> 16:25.820
If I were you, I'd try to find a roommate.

16:25.980 --> 16:30.360
Otherwise, you're well on your way to killing yourself at work.

16:30.740 --> 16:31.650
How much do you pay?

16:32.200 --> 16:32.860
50,000 yen.

16:33.240 --> 16:34.120
Do you have a job?

16:34.280 --> 16:36.580
Not yet, but it's in the pipeline.

16:36.740 --> 16:38.740
And you're going to get by?

16:38.950 --> 16:40.330
I have some savings,

16:40.500 --> 16:43.250
and my family gave me some money too.

16:43.580 --> 16:45.460
Ah well, easy then.

16:46.040 --> 16:47.800
You shouldn't have too much trouble.

16:48.170 --> 16:49.590
As long as we look after you...

16:49.760 --> 16:52.470
What do you know, exactly?

16:55.220 --> 16:58.430
Don't think I've got it easy either!

16:58.970 --> 17:01.770
Thanks for the coffee. I'll be off.

17:13.610 --> 17:14.570
Wait a minute!

17:15.660 --> 17:17.580
Wow, you're fast.

17:20.910 --> 17:22.540
Look, I'm sorry.

17:23.160 --> 17:26.500
You're out in the world at your age.

17:27.380 --> 17:28.790
Some life you got.

17:29.880 --> 17:31.170
You got a dream?

17:31.670 --> 17:33.840
No, I can't really say that.

17:34.010 --> 17:35.050
You sure about that?

17:36.010 --> 17:38.300
I didn't leave everything behind to realize a dream...

17:38.930 --> 17:41.310
I just didn't feel like I belonged anywhere.

17:41.720 --> 17:46.270
I don't know, I was constantly being treated like I didn't belong.

17:46.600 --> 17:48.310
I couldn't let that happen.

17:48.810 --> 17:51.780
Yeah, I understand. I apologize.

17:52.570 --> 17:53.990
What was that all about?

17:54.650 --> 17:55.740
I just mean...

17:56.070 --> 17:58.070
was there a reason you left?

17:58.240 --> 18:01.830
Not really, no. Small stuff, the usual.

18:03.250 --> 18:05.000
Is this about Diamond Dust?

18:05.500 --> 18:10.090
Yes, it is. Of course, we discussed copyright when we split up.

18:10.710 --> 18:13.800
As they intended to stay in the business...

18:14.300 --> 18:15.470
You signed it over to them.

18:15.800 --> 18:20.600
I foolishly thought I'd come up with a song that would have the same success.

18:22.100 --> 18:22.720
What?

18:24.430 --> 18:26.480
You're sweet and a good sport at the same time.

18:27.310 --> 18:30.230
Anyway, I think it's very classy of you.

18:32.400 --> 18:33.860
Ouch, that hurts!

18:34.530 --> 18:36.030
- Are you blushing?
- Nonsense!

18:36.200 --> 18:38.990
Stop it, anything but my hair!

18:43.370 --> 18:44.580
Shall we do karaoke?

18:45.040 --> 18:45.910
Right now?

18:51.380 --> 18:53.380
Hey, you know your classics.

18:53.840 --> 18:55.510
I can thank my grandmother.

18:55.840 --> 18:58.510
Funny how you got so hooked on Diamond Dust.

18:58.880 --> 19:02.510
Yeah, I know. I discovered you guys when I was at my worst.

19:02.890 --> 19:06.520
It's like you put into words what I was feeling.

19:08.440 --> 19:09.940
"Don't give up."

19:10.860 --> 19:12.520
That's become my credo.

19:17.490 --> 19:20.160
Tonight was the last time.

19:20.360 --> 19:23.700
The last time I sang a Diamond Dust song.

19:24.870 --> 19:25.700
Listen...

19:25.870 --> 19:27.290
Let's hear the next one.

19:38.010 --> 19:39.510
Ouch...

19:41.800 --> 19:43.300
Ah, it's just you.

19:44.640 --> 19:45.430
<i>Hi there.</i>

19:45.930 --> 19:50.640
<i>By the time you read this, the movers will already be here.</i>

19:51.350 --> 19:55.860
<i>I'm going to collect my pay before heading for the station.</i>

19:56.570 --> 20:00.070
<i>Take my guitar. It's my going-away present.</i>

20:01.280 --> 20:03.530
I hope you enjoy Tokyo.

20:06.870 --> 20:09.160
I'm so sorry. I'll let you in.

20:10.330 --> 20:13.000
Yes, thank you very much.

20:20.130 --> 20:21.970
<i>Good luck, everyone!</i>

20:31.270 --> 20:33.100
<i>Flip 'em off!</i>

20:34.150 --> 20:35.480
I won't be long!

20:56.790 --> 20:57.630
Momoka?

20:58.210 --> 20:59.300
Momoka...

21:01.550 --> 21:03.800
Momoka? Momoka!

21:11.140 --> 21:11.980
I'm sorry.

21:12.140 --> 21:13.640
Hey, you!

21:14.060 --> 21:16.400
<i>Momoka. Momoka!</i>

21:17.020 --> 21:18.480
<i>Are you sure about this?</i>

21:18.770 --> 21:21.320
<i>There'll be no turning back!</i>

21:21.690 --> 21:26.280
<i>Once you give up, it's joever!</i>

21:27.280 --> 21:28.490
Are you sure you're okay?

21:28.910 --> 21:32.410
<i>Okay, you might think this is stupid,</i>

21:33.000 --> 21:35.920
<i>but I'm here because I refuse to give up.</i>

21:36.500 --> 21:38.920
<i>And I don't want you to give up either.</i>

21:39.300 --> 21:42.170
<i>I mean, come on.</i>

21:43.470 --> 21:47.180
<i>Raise your middle finger with me!</i>

21:59.900 --> 22:01.190
You can sing, can't you?

22:04.030 --> 22:04.570
Yes.

22:09.490 --> 22:12.620
<i>Everything is so white
Everything is so slow</i>

22:12.790 --> 22:17.790
<i>All answers are empty of substance</i>

22:18.040 --> 22:22.460
<i>My fingers are static
My fingers are trembling</i>

22:22.630 --> 22:29.260
<i>Motionless at a crossroads
that doesn't appear on any map</i>

22:29.430 --> 22:36.060
<i>What can I rely on to guide me?</i>

22:36.230 --> 22:39.190
<i>Just follow the common sense manual</i>

22:39.480 --> 22:41.730
<i>And all its empty words</i>

22:41.900 --> 22:47.700
<i>The days come and go</i>

22:48.820 --> 22:55.370
<i>Will filling this void
give meaning to our lives?</i>

22:55.540 --> 23:01.090
<i>How can we hope to move forward?</i>

23:01.290 --> 23:04.460
<i>Everything is so white
Everything is so slow</i>

23:04.630 --> 23:09.640
<i>All answers are empty of substance</i>

23:09.930 --> 23:13.680
<i>My fingers are static
My fingers are trembling</i>

23:14.310 --> 23:17.310
<i>There's no written answer
No stinging failure</i>

23:17.600 --> 23:22.690
<i>I've always been who I am
And I'll always be who I was</i>

23:22.860 --> 23:28.700
<i>No matter how hard I fight
There will be no tomorrow</i>

23:37.500 --> 23:41.670
<i>Even if I resist
There will be no tomorrow</i>

23:46.090 --> 23:48.920
<i>Next Episode: "Three Nocturnal Creatures".</i>
